  destinations:
  - destinationName: Paris Riverside
    description: "Gleaming cobblestones line the gentle curves of the Seine. Golden
      wrought-iron lamp posts cast a warm glow. Elegant bridges connect bustling
      riverside paths. Street caf\xE9s invite visitors to pause and relax. A timeless
      Parisian charm fills the waterfront."
    background: {fileID: -1579264983832029839, guid: 3eb3f0ab5b8a74e6d995b24bcc648318, type: 3}
  - destinationName: Lavender Countryside
    description: Rolling lavender fields stretch beyond the horizon. Soft purple
      blooms sway beneath sunny skies. Stone cottages rest among fragrant countryside
      trails. Gentle breezes carry the scent of summer flowers. Peaceful landscapes
      create a dreamlike escape.
    background: {fileID: -7332940881521879221, guid: 48b7c4421f05e4a54b67f7c5d56447b0, type: 3}
  - destinationName: Palace Garden
    description: Perfectly trimmed hedges frame elegant walking paths. Fountains
      sparkle beneath grand palace balconies, Colorful flowerbeds brighten every
      corner of the grounds. Historic sculptures stand among lush greenery. Royal
      beauty surrounds every peaceful stroll.
    background: {fileID: 3714179775775961647, guid: cc524d7a6d4ea4c66852930fb938e399, type: 3}
